Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for contacting Admission Services. Residency for tuition purposes is determined by the answers you provided regarding residency on your application. Information about residency can be found at students.asu.edu/residency. 

If you have questions regarding your classification, contact the residency classification office at residency@asu.edu or 480-965-7712.

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}


If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.

